  "name": "Teriyaki Sauce and Marinade",
  "subtitle": "A sweet-savory Japanese sauce with garlic and ginger",
  "description": "Simmer mirin, soy sauce, sugar, vinegar, sesame oil, and aromatics into a versatile teriyaki sauce or marinade.",
